          "tz": 600
        },
        "subject": "LU-21180 lod: prepare lod for kunit testability",
        "message": "LU-21180 lod: prepare lod for kunit testability\n\nKUnit tests for LOD need access to internal helpers that are\ncurrently static, and need to redirect a few calls that have side\neffects (starting kernel threads, touching real storage) that cannot\nrun under a unit test.\n\nExport the helpers that the new KUnit suites call directly, and add\nKUNIT_STATIC_STUB_REDIRECT() to the handful of functions tests need\nto stub out, splitting lod_sub_start_recovery_thread() out of\nlod_sub_init_llog() so it can be redirected independently of its\ncaller.\n\nThis patch only prepares the module for testing; the tests\nthemselves land in later patches.\n\nTest-Parameters: ignore\nSigned-off-by: Ronnie Sahlberg <rsahlberg@whamcloud.com>\nAssisted-by: AGENT:claude-sonnet-5 [augment-code]\nChange-Id: I56786f7c3964eebe03933cd3ccd601b4a9f4584e\nSigned-off-by: Ronnie Sahlberg <rsahlberg@whamcloud.com>\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
  },
